Package: tidycrates
Type: Package
Title: Tidy Data from the 'Discogs' API
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Massimiliano", "Canzi", , "massimiliano.canzi@uni-konstanz.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6124-0321"))
Description: Sends requests to the 'Discogs' application programming
    interface (API) <https://www.discogs.com/developers> and returns the
    results as tidy tibbles. The 'Discogs' database can be searched, and
    releases, master releases, artists and labels can be read from it,
    along with the releases of an artist or label and the versions of a
    master release. The collection folders, collection and wantlist of a
    user can be listed, tallied and plotted, and marketplace statistics,
    price suggestions and collection values can be read. Tracklists,
    credits, formats, identifiers and companies of releases can be
    unnested into one row per item. Requests can be made with a personal
    access token or without one. They are spaced out to stay within the
    rate limit of the API and retried when the limit is exceeded.
    Responses can be cached for the session, and paginated results can be
    fetched in full.
